    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot; is a 2D Sokoban-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to push boxes marked with different attributes while following rock-paper-scissors rules to move them to designated spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! Some incorrect moves will cause boxes to disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the challenge begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokoban, but with Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.poster.avif?t=1751005485\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.webm?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.mp4?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not lose before reaching the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.poster.avif?t=1751005485\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.webm?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.mp4?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more companions? Let's play Rock-Paper-Scissors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/2f0335ce35dfdcdb68b04de503aa3c55.poster.avif?t=1751005485\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/2f0335ce35dfdcdb68b04de503aa3c55.webm?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/2f0335ce35dfdcdb68b04de503aa3c55.mp4?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot; is a 2D Sokoban-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to push boxes marked with different attributes while following rock-paper-scissors rules to move them to designated spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! Some incorrect moves will cause boxes to disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the challenge begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokoban, but with Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.poster.avif?t=1751005485\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.webm?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/e10198772171c339006bd92b44b9ea7b.mp4?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not lose before reaching the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.poster.avif?t=1751005485\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.webm?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/dfee372c890eb452d444f2163d6680bd.mp4?t=1751005485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more companions? Let's play Rock-Paper-Scissors too!</p><p